erties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"header","children":[{"type":"text","value":"header"}]},{"type":"code","value":"header: Signal<Header<TFeatures, TData, TValue>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/helpers/header.ts#L17","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/angular-table/src/helpers/header.ts:17"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Signal that returns the current header instance."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"interface-tanstacktableheadercontexttfeatures-tdata-tvalue","text":"Interface: TanStackTableHeaderContext<TFeatures, TData, TValue>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"header","text":"header","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Interface: TanStackTableHeaderContext\\<TFeatures, TData, TValue\\>\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/helpers/header.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/helpers/header.ts#L11)\n\nDI context shape for a TanStack Table header.\n\nThis exists to make the current `Header` injectable by any nested component/directive\nwithout passing it through inputs/props.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `CellData`\n\n## Properties\n\n### header\n\n```ts\nheader: Signal<Header<TFeatures, TData, TValue>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/helpers/header.ts:17](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/helpers/header.ts#L17)\n\nSignal that returns the current header instance.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: TanStackTableHeaderContext\ntitle: TanStackTableHeaderContext\n---\n\n# Interface: TanStackTableHeaderContext\\<TFeatures, TData, TValue\\>\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/helpers/header.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/helpers/header.ts#L11)\n\nDI context shape for a TanStack Table header.\n\nThis exists to make the current `Header` injectable by any nested component/directive\nwithout passing it through inputs/props.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `CellData`\n\n## Properties\n\n### header\n\n```ts\nheader: Signal<Header<TFeatures, TData, TValue>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/helpers/header.ts:17](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/helpers/header.ts#L17)\n\nSignal that returns the current header instance.\n"}
